にちは。あなたの絵はとてもきれいだと思うので、私のキャラクターを何人か描いていただきたいと思いました。私のキャラクター、Urie (https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/912864563228180511/1081739287101460660/d7dc08f8_fb80_4e6b_9b58_ae192f7a6558_by_eeviebun-dc6p3f9.jpg) とGale (https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/492425218128740382/987398210421161984/Sylvana_Fox3.png) がキスをしているところを描いてほしいのです。可能であれば、ウリエは妊娠していて、ゲイルの膝の上に座っていて、ウェディングランジェリーのセットを着ているものにしていただけませんか？これと似たようなもの https://img.joomcdn.net/bea1e38d2392675bce16027e468cfd9c60b0a446_original.jpeg\n参考文献の記載が不十分であったことをお詫びします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wolfox004/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59677662/uploads/origins/c9f81aa2-028e-4423-bf02-d0191f997be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e646994723877bf808b0143b1c69f112", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59677662/uploads/origins/c9f81aa2-028e-4423-bf02-d0191f997be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e646994723877bf808b0143b1c69f112, https://si.imgix.net/59677662/uploads/origins/c9f81aa2-028e-4423-bf02-d0191f997be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c1945a9b3811e6b930a073593573201e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59677662/uploads/origins/c9f81aa2-028e-4423-bf02-d0191f997be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7b21b4df6abf9f83f036bfaf9213acf7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wolfox004/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0a95f12/uploads/origins/8ae80672-52ea-4011-8b39-cb506ad6fccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=73e4dbd0bdf3ad18589fa939426f1b51", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0a95f12/uploads/origins/8ae80672-52ea-4011-8b39-cb506ad6fccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=73e4dbd0bdf3ad18589fa939426f1b51, https://si.imgix.net/a0a95f12/uploads/origins/8ae80672-52ea-4011-8b39-cb506ad6fccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4ff29610b678faec413822eb1c30da51 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0a95f12/uploads/origins/8ae80672-52ea-4011-8b39-cb506ad6fccb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d38a94d7cb904b9b139b3c59a147369e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@wolfox004/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/158882eb/uploads/origins/dad083de-91a7-487d-9b21-c69bc1422a70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c6f1e91521b82599f5d4467e2646b250", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/158882eb/uploads/origins/dad083de-91a7-487d-9b21-c69bc1422a70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c6f1e91521b82599f5d4467e2646b250, https://si.imgix.net/158882eb/uploads/origins/dad083de-91a7-487d-9b21-c69bc1422a70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&